[label start]
A quiet evening. While it rains or snows, W hides or shows the weather; K opens the achievements.
[achieve prologue]
[weather rain]
It starts to rain.
[if weather.kind == 'rain' -> wet]
(Not shown: the script reads weather.kind and jumps.)
[label wet]
The script read weather.kind and knows it is raining.
[weather snow intensity=0.4]
The rain turns to snow.
[achieve first_choice]
[weather clear]
The sky clears.
[achieve true_end]
That is all. Open the menu (or press K) to see the achievements.
